not yours to repair in this round: name the file and the error in your completion
summary and declare completion. Do not spend the round trying to reach a clean
build you are not allowed to reach.

When every listed file is resolved and marker-free, call the
{{ DECLARE_COMPLETE_TOOL_REFERENCE }} MCP tool with a short
summary of what you resolved.

